### Requêtes de test (VS Code « REST Client » ou Visual Studio)
@api = http://localhost:5080/api

GET {{api}}/health

###
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "identifier": "jean.dupont@mail.com", "password": "voyage123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{api}}/trips?from=Douala&to=Yaoundé&date=2026-10-28

###
POST {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tripId": "DLA-YDE-20261028-6", "seats": [3], "passengerName": "Jean Dupont", "method": "OrangeMoney", "accountNumber": "690123456" }

###
GET {{api}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{api}}/tickets/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payload": "BT-XXXXXX", "board": false }
